{"title":"TCK-3020","type":"Defect hardware","status":"Fermé","duration_minutes":20,"description":"The temp sensor in one of our tunnels is reading wrong. Saying it is 30+ degrees and it is actually around 10c. It started yesterday overnight for us noticing but on the graph it looks like a glitch on Oct 2 around 10pm.

Any ideas for troubleshooting this?
I have it on manual now so it will not vent thinking it is hot.","notes":null}

{"title":"TCK-2863","type":"Aide software","status":"Fermé","duration_minutes":15,"description":"Hello, 
 I wanted to ask about the “pump” feature. If I set each greenhouse up with a pump will it stagger the watering? Or do all the valves need to be on one pump? 

Thanks!","notes":null}

{"title":"TCK-2738","type":"Aide software","status":"Fermé","duration_minutes":0,"description":"Salut Philippe,
Je viens d’arriver dans la serre 2 où il fait 14, mais avec une consigne de 21. Orisha indique que mes fournaises fonctionnent mais ce n’est pas le cas et les roll-up sont tous les deux ouverts, mais ça indique qu’ils sont à 0%.

Peux-tu regarder si tu vois quelque chose qui pourrait expliquer l’ouverture des roll-up stp?","notes":null}

{"title":"TCK-1169","type":"Aide hardware","status":"Fermé","duration_minutes":30,"description":"on gosse encore sur sa fournaise....

